        },
        "value": {
          "_": "<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Pre-Hanging      Available: </strong>Single Door and Double Door      Options</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wood      Species:</strong> American  Walnut (possibility of some knots)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Construction:</strong> Engineered Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fire      Rated</strong>: 20, 45 and 60 minute options      available. Please contact us for a quote</li>\r\n<li><strong>Impact      Rated: </strong>Capable of being impact rated</li>\r\n<li><strong>Custom      Capabilities</strong>: custom sizes, shapes and      designs available</li>\r\n<li><strong>Warranty</strong>: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li>\r\n<li><strong>Project      Application</strong>: Used for new construction and      replacement</li>\r\n<li><strong>NFRC      Rated U-Factor:</strong> 0.40</li>\r\n<li><strong>NFRC      Rated SHGC:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0.04</li>\r\n<li><strong>*Sold Unfinished </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>STC Rating- </strong>Sound Transmission Class (ASTM E 413): 28</li>\r\n<li><strong>OITC Rating: </strong>Outdoor-Indoor Transmission Class (ASTM E 1332): 26</li>\r\n<li><strong>R-Value: </strong>Resistance to Heat Loss:<strong> </strong>2.5</li>\r\n</ul>",
          "$": {
            "xsi:type": "xsd:string"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$": {
          "xsi:type": "ns1:associativeEntity"
        },
        "key": {
          "_": "overview",
          "$": {
            "xsi:type": "xsd:string"
          }
        },
        "value": {
          "_": "<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Please note: Doors are unfinished (the pictures may depict a finished door)</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>*Square Sticking Compression Fit (no step) *<br /> <br /> </strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Request a Free Corner Sample to See the ETO Quality Difference</strong><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ripon</strong><strong>- Interior Walnut 2-Panel Shaker Doors</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Premium interior walnut shaker doors at unbeatable prices &ndash; buy interior wood doors manufacturer direct. Low price guarantee on all our walnut interior doors. Pro discount program trade pricing available for contractors, architects, and designers. We maintain affordable prices by leveraging high-volume sales to commercial sectors, hospitality, custom home builders, architects, and designers. Request a free corner sample to see the ETO quality difference.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>The Napa walnut interior 2-panel shaker wood doors are crafted from premium walnut veneers, ensuring exceptional consistency and minimal imperfections. Our interior walnut 2-panel shaker doors are ideally suited for modern residential doors, contemporary doors, and commercial door openings. These meticulously crafted interior walnut doors are perfect to be used as bedroom doors, bathroom doors, closet doors, office doors, laundry doors, basement doors, dining room doors, living room doors, pantry doors, and kitchen doors. Our walnut 2-panel shaker interior doors can be pre-hung and can also be fire-rated for an additional fee.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>The PBC (particleboard core) construction of our 2-panel shaker interior walnut doors offers several key benefits, including enhanced durability, improved sound insulation, and a smooth, even surface for the staining process.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Brand You Can Trust</strong>&mdash;a leader in the industry for over 20 years, delivering top-quality doors nationwide and worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Free Samples:&nbsp;</strong>Request a Free Walnut Interior Door Corner Sample to See the ETO Quality Difference.</li>\r\n<li><strong>PRO Discounts</strong>: Pro discount program trade pricing available for contractors, architects, and designers on all our interior walnut doors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lowest Prices Nationwide</strong>: At ETO Doors, we leverage our mass production to manufacture these high-quality interior walnut doors at the lowest prices in the country, passing significant savings directly to you.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Versatile Usage</strong>: Our walnut doors are perfect for residential and commercial settings, including new construction and remodeling projects. Our two panel interior doors are installed in places with high-traffic volumes such as multifamily homes, office buildings, and hotels.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Customization Available</strong>: We understand that every project is unique. Our wood walnut shaker doors can be customized to fit your specific size and design requirements, ensuring a perfect fit and look for any application.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Optional Features (at an additional cost)</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>20-Minute Fire Rating for Wood Doors Available</strong>: Interior 2-panel shaker walnut doors fire rated to withstand fire for 20 minutes, certified by UL or Warnock Hersey.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Interior Pre-hanging</strong>: Our solid core walnut interior doors can be pre-hung with matching engineered walnut jambs or finger joint white primed jambs as pre-hung single doors or pre-hung double doors units.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span>&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>",
